{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から寒かったあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨かあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"非常にアンニュイな気持ちだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし私は仕事終わったあとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吉祥寺散策をした！アクティブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきな雑貨屋さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"閉店したのがショックでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...がーんがーんがーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでまたテンション下がりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので私は歩き回りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな素敵なお店見つけました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずあしいたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお疲れ様自分"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ苔にはまってたんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってコメント多かった笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔は私の癒しです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も自分で作ってみたいんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"材料はどこで買ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本体の部分は貴和製作所とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hands beで買ったりします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AVRILの糸はぜんぶかわいいのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい集めてるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青柳文子さん知ってますかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっしししっしってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいすきです。本持ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雰囲気とか服装とか全部素敵だなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていっつも眺めてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番ダンスやってて楽しい曲はー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってて楽しくない曲はないよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから全部楽しいんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日言ってたブローチ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速今日付けてみた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/12/4858497/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}